  m_text: "Legend has it that those who control the cheese control the world. For
    many years now humans have controlled the cheese. Rats were forced to depend
    on the humans for cheese. \r\n\r\nRecently, Queen Rat made a discovery\u2013
    a human recipe book. She has tasked you and your brother to discover this recipe
    book. Maybe if you learn this recipe, you can free the rats.\r\n"
